Subject: [PATCH] Port resources-and-branding to Signal 8.33.2, part 3

Resolve shared resource conflicts and relocated resources, retaining the port source's Molly branding and translations.

These are AI-generated compatibility resolutions from the existing
PR #7 port source, exported after Git has performed its deterministic
three-way merge of the unchanged official Molly 8.19.2-4 snapshot
with Signal 8.33.2. The original Molly mailboxes remain unchanged.
Offset-only movement and conflict-free automatic merges are already
in the parent tree and are not re-exported as patch rewrites.

This batch owns 25 whole-file changes. It preserves the
previous port tree exactly and makes no new application changes.
The source commit records a derived candidate, not an official
Molly release or a claim of upstream authorship.

